vidyāntaraṃ pravakṣyāmi caturvargapradāyakam |

(tatra vāgbhavakūṭam)

vāgbhavaṃ gaganaṃ hādyamuṣmā bhautikabindumān || 92 ||

jyotsnā māyā mādanendramahāmāyāsamanvitam |
etattu vāgbhavaṃ kūṭaṃ sarvapakṣeṣu śobhanam || 93 ||

