	<92-95 |> atha kūṭatrayātmikāṃ caturviṃśatyakṣarīṃ vidyāmāha(-)vidyāntaramityādinā | 
tatra prathamaṃ vāgbhavakūṭamāha(-)vāgbhaveti | vāgbhavaṃ ai(/) gaganaṃ hakāraḥ(,) hādyaṃ 
hakārasyādyaṃ sakāraḥ(,) uṣmā rakāraḥ(,) sa ca bhautikabindumān bhautika aikāraḥ 
bindurnādabinduḥ tābhyāṃ yukta ityarthaḥ | etena ai(/) ha sa rai(/) iti prāptam | ṭipianyāntu ai(/) ha 
