	<223 |> ekamiti | ekaṃ paraṃbrahmasamāgamaṃ varaṃ ko'pi na lebhe ato'laṃ te 
tatprārthanayā | tat kiṃ mayā labhyamityata āha (-) adhunetyādi |

	<226 |> mantrāditi kīlitamantrādityarthaḥ |




